docs {
  # Day 3, Saturday morning — I gave in. I'm registering. I'm using a
  # plus-tag on my Gmail so I can throw this account away later if
  # they start spamming me. APPLICANT — I have no intention of
  # listing anything; I just want to bid on a flat in Surulere.
  #
  # I expect to get either a confirmation email or a JWT back. If they
  # send me a verification email, that's reassuring. If they just say
